{"parse": {"title": "11TH-06", "pageid": 110479, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-05\" title=\"11TH-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">11TH-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-07\" title=\"11TH-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">11TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.8F.8D.E6.88.98.E5.AE.A3.E8.A8.80\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"反战宣言\">反战宣言</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 反战宣言</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Push for Peace</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>公<span class=\"color-value\"></span>文<span class=\"color-value\"></span>包<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>装<span class=\"color-value\"></span>着<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>毋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>庸<span class=\"color-value\"></span>置<span class=\"color-value\"></span>疑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>和<span class=\"color-value\"></span>平<span class=\"color-value\"></span>主<span class=\"color-value\"></span>义<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11106</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_gongmu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_gongmu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>陌生人再次端详起玛尔纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>不易动怒的，胜过勇士；能克制己心的，强于攻城。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>——什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>我喜欢你的冷静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫名所以的赞许令战地医生有些摸不着头脑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我有问题要问你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>正好，我也需要一个答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>为什么你要刺杀上校？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>我们的问题是相对的——为什么要保护希施费尔德？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱指向身旁的山坡，简陋的墓碑伫立在纵横交错的沟壑中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-526515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-526515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-526515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>因为不要再让更多人遭到战争的摧残。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>我也一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你杀死的人是停火的希望，你有什么资格为这些死去的人献花？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身下，苍白的花儿在干燥的风中翻滚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“哨兵”轻轻靠前一步，用雨披挡住冷风，不至于让野菊花过早地被风吹走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>战争已经进行了六年，和平不像你所想的那样容易到来。你对你——还有基金会在做的事情了解多少？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我们很清楚自己在做什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>总参谋部有停火的意愿，所以他们才派出代表——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>呵——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻声嘲笑，仿佛看到一只试图证明自己更强大的小动物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>如果你们清楚，就不会把希施费尔德当成和谈的希望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>也许在你们看来，他的死导致前线战火重燃，可是……即使我不杀他，谈判也注定会失败。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>重塑之手早已做好了计划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你接触过重塑之手？<br />不，难道你的意思是说——希施费尔德是重塑之手的成员？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻的沉默之后，狙击手开始讲述。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>与重塑之手有牵连的人分为两类。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>希施费尔德是第一类。他们与重塑之手合作，换取继续战争的资源和技术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处，遥远的炮火声如受困巨兽的哀嚎，它越过山头，滚落到公墓所处的谷地中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刺杀军官的狙击手伸出了第二根指头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>第二种，是重塑之手通过神秘学手段影响的普通人。这些人对战争与荣誉抱有狂热到异常的渴望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>解说者的目光转向一旁缄口不言的收尸人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>你的营长，艾伯哈特·布劳恩是第二种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士官缓慢地理解着对方话语中的含义。再次开口时，他的语调产生了微不可察的变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你会杀死他吗？——就像希施费尔德一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>这取决于他的死会带来多少价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>布劳恩少校的士官未作回答，即使面部被遮盖，仍能从他身上看出一种陷于困顿的茫然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你刚刚说的那些……与重塑之手有关的话，你要怎么证明？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>如果你知道些什么，基金会可以听取你的信息，我们可以达成合作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>至少，你可以先证明对希施费尔德上校的指控——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>我不会自证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>我尝试过，而且也已因此受到过审判与侮辱。<br />那些靴子上连泥点都没有的大人物从来不会在乎士兵们能证明什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>如果他们有能力理解前线士兵万分之一的痛苦，这场战争在一开始就会结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>对于你们——我不相信一群官僚能带来和平。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她收回目光，拉住雨披的一角，将自己紧紧裹住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>到此为止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……请你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在吊唁者即将离去的那一刻，卡戎突然开口，似乎方才他一直在试图理解前者对他说过的最后一句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>——请你给艾伯哈特·布劳恩一个生存的机会，我会让他活着变得更有……价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“哨兵”：</div><div>这与我无关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“1920年，战争已经成为一种混杂不清的总体印象，它被灌注以多种形式的英雄主义与悲伤情绪。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“它塑造出一种残酷的现实性观念：战争必然是新时代的序曲。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“如若不然……如若千万计的死亡只是旧时代的一场阵痛，那么我们的文明观念将被彻底粉碎。”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-523701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-523701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-523701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>人去楼空啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“Ⅻ”小队队长站在蒙佩的街道上，凝视着希施费尔德上校遇害的现场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他抵达时，所有军方人员已经从安全区撤走，只有少数仍在值守的基金会人员守着略显凄凉的废墟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-526320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-526320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-526320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>“乌鸫”，过来帮把手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-524120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-524120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-524120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>等我吃完这口，“警官”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随他一同抵达的小队成员正在重新布置镇子内的防御工事，如今他们的防线已经收缩到了街道的一角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会安保：</div><div>长官，除了您本人的小队成员，目前可供调遣的武装人员共有122名，其中23人为神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会安保：</div><div>这是他们的个人资料，请您过目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人接过安保队员递来的人事资料，目光转向悬挂着基金会旗帜的临时指挥所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>我会仔细阅读，现在请你回到岗位。重点确保指挥所的安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会安保：</div><div>明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安保人员转身离去。与此同时，身穿甲胄的战地医生迎上前来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>是你，玛尔纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你知道我的名字，刻雷乌斯长官？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>我在路上读过你的报告——关于在森林和公墓中遇见的狙击手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>嗯，在报告里我遗漏了两件事——刺杀事件发生时，有个不知名的人通过基金会的通讯器向我发出了警告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>这件事不用在意，第二件呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>不用……好的，另一件事是，那名狙击手应该是一个石像鬼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>石像鬼？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>没错，这支神秘学家族裔中的一部分人在大战中加入了军队，作为神秘术反制与支援部队投入战场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>他们能石化自己的器官，抵挡轻武器和流弹的伤害。同时，石像鬼似乎有方法让人忽视他们的存在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>你之前和石像鬼有过交手？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>长官的提问令报告人陷入了短暂的低落，但后者还是如实回答了问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……可以这么说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>所以，她是通过特殊的神秘术绕过了基金会对蒙佩的监视……应该向总部申领反制神秘术的监测设备……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>对希施费尔德的刺杀有极强的针对性，她或许掌握了相当多关于重塑之手的情报……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵急促的脚步声打断了刻雷乌斯的思考。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>刻雷乌斯先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一名孤独的访客突然造访，他穿着体面的服装，却难掩刚刚经过一路颠沛的现状。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>我是跨党团委员会的代表，格奥尔格。我希望代表帝国议会与基金会就和平谈判展开新的交涉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>和平谈判已经被取消了，格奥尔格先生，蒙佩已经没有政治的空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>基金会仍然留在这里，只是为了追查重塑之手的踪迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>议员向前一步，虽然他谨慎地压低了声音，但仍旧难掩一丝急促的激动情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>……我正是为这个目的而来，先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>我得到了基金会的警告——重塑之手正在掌控军队的权力，我对这样的前景深感担忧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>我们的国家已站在崩溃的边缘，从政治与理智上来说，这场战争毫无继续下去的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>总参谋部却对国内的艰难困境视而不见，如此失控地继续推动战争，我严重怀疑有重塑之手参与其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>这么说，这是总参谋部并不知情的秘密造访。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一针见血的判断令对方稍有尴尬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>或许是想显露出一些权威性，跨党团代表忽然整顿了一番自己的仪态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>我代表的是帝国议会中的大多数，在和平问题上，首相也站在我们这一边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>几乎所有党派都已经联合起来，我们需要的只是一份压倒性的证据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>如果我能向皇帝和议会证明，军队已经被邪教团体掌控，他们将立刻倒台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>也就是说，你希望我向你分享追查重塑之手的结果，用以对抗军队的权力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>没错，在议会取得决定权之后，我们会尽一切努力推动和平谈判。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他郑重其事地点头，突如其来的冬季风还是将他的头发与衣领吹乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他深吸一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>我们愿意接受一定限度的有条件和平。当然，这不只是因为我所代表的政治立场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>为了国家和人民的未来，这场战争绝不能再继续下去了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "11TH-06"}}